  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anticipatory action to help populations to prepare for cyclones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the resilience of vulnerable communities against cyclones by reinforcing shelters and reducing material losses. It combines public awareness, infrastructure improvements, and financial support through cash transfers, in order to decrease the risk of forced displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
